| 250K | 2.65 | 2.44–2.89 (p95 3.28) | 12.18 | 11.97–12.48 (p95 12.81) | **4.60x** | 15.71 | 2.022515e-11 | WIN | 115.28ms |
| 1M | 5.82 | 5.29–6.55 (p95 7.22) | 30.78 | 28.75–32.15 (p95 34.27) | **5.29x** | 13.47 | 5.016490e-10 | WIN | 362.43ms |

